  "description": "The glTF box with its two walls hung off a group node using core::child links. A core::child component carries no value: the name of the reference is the id of the child node, so one node can hold many children and a later section can drop a single link with a DELETE on that name. Composing this produces a GLB whose scene holds the group as its only root, with the walls as its children.",
